'''Mr. Ninja''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that is obtainable from the [[Nyanko Rangers (Event Gacha)|Nyanko Rangers]] Event Gacha. It was added in [[Version 3.7 Update|Version 3.7]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 184
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Mr. Ninja
|name2 = Mint
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Mint''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Though 440 range area attacks may seem good on paper for something with [[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Delinquent Cat]]'s recharge, the main problem stems from this unit's horribly low stats. In terms of accumulating DPS, this unit is outclassed by even generalists like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]]. The extra range, while seemingly helpful, only lets her outrange [[Corrupted Valkyrie]], [[I.M. Phace]], [[Maawth]], [[Le'Solar]], and [[Ursamajor]], all of which she will take a very long time to kill with her horrible damage. Said enemies are much better dealt with by [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], who has even higher range and usable stats. Her low health, knockback count, and lack of defensive abilities means that she is practically impossible to keep alive without excessive meatshielding.

