==Trivia==
*Before being obtainable from the [[What's in the Box (Event Gacha)|What's in the Box]] Event Gacha, Mr. Ninja was obtainable during the [[Mr.Ninja!! Fever Collaboration Event]]. It could be obtained by clearing the first gate in adventure mode in the ''Mr. Ninja!! Fever'' game.
*Mr. Ninja's Evolved Form was originally named '''Lily''' before being changed to '''Mint''' upon release.
*Prior to [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]], Mr. Ninja targeted [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] enemies.

